Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:56:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 47/48] Instanced and moving emitters: area lights in object
 instance definitions become one mesh-mode DiffuseAreaLight per instance
 (shared per-prototype triangle table, sampled through the instance transform
 at the reference time); LightSampleContext time; hit-aware MIS pdf (for
 hdPbrt)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
